></strong></div></div><p class="confirmation-note">Your order will be placed only after you confirm. Your receipt will appear next. Wallet payments remain subject to staff verification.</p></div><footer class="confirmation-actions"><button type="button" id="confirmation-edit">Edit Order</button><button type="button" class="confirmation-submit" id="confirmation-submit">Confirm &amp; place order <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></button></footer></dialog><?php endif;?></main><script src="https://api.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/v3.33.0/mapbox-gl.js"></script><script src="../js/pin-area.js?v=4" defer></script><script src="../js/checkout-location.js?v=10" defer></script><script src="../js/checkout-payment.js" defer></script><script src="../js/cart-validation.js?v=20261027-3" defer></script><script src="../js/cart-fulfillment.js?v=1" defer></script></body></html>
